{"4575630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blast Vein", "steam_appid": 4575630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575630/extras/34dcfff980ae6249a68cb811ce676591.poster.avif?t=1783919812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575630/extras/34dcfff980ae6249a68cb811ce676591.webm?t=1783919812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER AXIOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of flesh and machine, locked in constant failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AXIOM was meant to end suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pill designed to let humanity descend into the subconscious and erase pain at its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn’t heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It forces you to confront it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BRUTAL RETRO FPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on, every shot matters. Survival comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons. More power. More control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more everything escalates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stop surviving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start dominating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575630/extras/cb4049e119e2aaa1e73f9183f6cdf2ab.poster.avif?t=1783919812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575630/extras/cb4049e119e2aaa1e73f9183f6cdf2ab.webm?t=1783919812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, high-impact boomer shooter combat focused on speed, precision, and momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike structure where each descent escalates your power and the threats you face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival early game that evolves into overwhelming firepower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomechanical horror world rendered in stark black-and-white visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subconscious descent into a shifting, unstable environment shaped by AXIOM</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575630/extras/34dcfff980ae6249a68cb811ce676591.poster.avif?t=1783919812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4575630/extras/34dcfff980ae6249a68cb811ce676591.webm?t=1783919812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTER AXIOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world of flesh and machine, locked in constant failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AXIOM was meant to end suffering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pill designed to let humanity descend into the subconscious and erase pain at its source.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn’t heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It forces you to confront it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A BRUTAL RETRO FPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on, every shot matters. Survival comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons. More power. More control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more everything escalates.</p><p cla